data=col3,Ports
data=col5,0,The following benefits are available for the <col=FF981F>entire duration</col> of Winter Weekends:
data=col5,0, 
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>25 voyages</col> a day instead of 15.
data=col5,0, 
data=col5,1,All Ports voyages return <col=FF981F>30% extra</col> trade goods or resources.
data=col5,0, 
