[dbrow_1663]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,7
data=col2,1484
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,Good people of Gielinor, thank you for coming.,sound_43606,300,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,For those of you who do not know me, my name is Seren. Some call me the goddess of the elves.,sound_43608,500,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,I have called you here because you represent every race of people and every god on Gielinor.,sound_43616,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,There is a threat, a threat which faces every one of us. One you may be unaware of.,sound_43945,450,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,The Elder Gods.,sound_43989,200,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,They are beings, older than our world. Indeed, they created this world, and indirectly everything on it.,sound_45006,550,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,Great artefacts, like the Stone of Jas, which have brought us war and woe for millennia, are merely their discarded tools.,sound_45042,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,They are so powerful, so far beyond all of us, that even we gods are nothing more than ants to them.,sound_45081,500,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,For the entire lifetime of this planet they have slept, but now they are waking up.,sound_45083,500,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_3,To them, this planet and all of its people are nothing more than food for their children.,sound_45085,450,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_3,They laid their eggs in the heart of the planet, and when they hatch, they will consume Gielinor and all life on it.,sound_45091,550,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_3,Then they will move on to the rest of the universe, destroying world after world, until their work is finished and there is nothing but darkness.,sound_45093,700,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,How can I know this?,sound_45094,200,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,Because I too am their child.,sound_45096,175,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,It fills my heart with pride to be considered the goddess of my people, but that is not my true identity.,sound_45098,500,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,My mother was an Elder God... though weak, deformed, abandoned. No Threat to Gielinor.,sound_45100,550,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,She created me, millions of years ago, along with- with... another.,sound_45101,450,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,I went out into the universe, discovered mortal life, and though it took time, I learned to appreciate the joy and wonder that your kind brings to existence.,sound_45103,800,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_1,I do not share the goal of my kin. I would not see life on this planet, in this universe, ended.,sound_45104,500,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,We have only one chance to avoid this fate.,sound_45292,300,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_4,You must meet with the Elder Gods. You must go before them, prove to them that you are more than merely food to be consumed.,sound_45354,550,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,I am sure that they will come to see your value as I have.,sound_45426,400,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,That is why I have brought you here. To warn you. To plead with you to make this case.,sound_45303,500,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_2,It is only by working together that you can do this. Only united can you show the Elder Gods that you are worthy.,sound_45427,600,false,true,true,true

[dbrow_1664]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,8
data=col1,218
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_5,The world guardian arrived just too late. Kerapac's plan had worked flawlessly.,sound_43551,400,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_5,With a triumphant shout he plunged the staff into the Needle to absorb its power. ,sound_43552,350,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_5,Gail watched in horror as control of the Needle was torn from her and given to the dragonkin. ,sound_43553,400,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_6,In an instant, she was Gail no more. Primrose stood, staring at the monster before her.,sound_43555,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_6,Kerapac roared in triumph, the power of the Needle now his to command.,sound_43558,350,false,true,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_7,He took to the air, and the Needle vanished from sight at the whim of its new master.,sound_43564,350,true,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_7,He flew east to the coast and out across the sea, vanishing into a great storm.,sound_43567,400,false,false,true,true
data=col3,cutscene_quest_chaos_7,And there he set to work on the next stage of his endeavour...,sound_43603,350,false,true,true,true

