data=col3,dino_cutscene_approach_01,The dragon told me the voyage would be treacherous but I have never seen a storm like this one.,sound_46517,400,true,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_cutscene_approach_02,The sea is primordial. It is ancient, and vast, like a thing from another time. The sky is angry. I can feel it.,sound_46518,450,true,false,true,false
