data=col2,5th August - 11th August
data=col3,Skilling Bonanza
data=col5,0,Gathering
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Divination</col> - Springs last twice as long and enriched wisps appear every 10 minutes.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Fishing</col> - Spots move <col=FF981F>half as frequently</col> as before. Excludes fishing frenzy.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Hunter</col> - 10% chance of gaining one more creature than normal.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Mining</col> - Chance to get extra ore.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Uncharted Isles</col> - 25% chance not to deplete resources while harvesting.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Woodcutting</col> - Trees replenish twice as fast.
data=col5,0, 
data=col5,0,Support
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Agility</col> - Higher chance of activating The Pit D&D.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Thieving</col> - Bonus chance on jewelled statuettes whilst wearing the Ring of Wealth and doubled chance of sceptre and Black Ibis drops at Pyramid Plunder.
data=col5,0, 
data=col5,0,Artisan
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Construction</col> - Chance to retain a plank with Scroll of proficiency increased by 10%.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Cooking</col> - Reduced chance to burn food.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Crafting</col> - 10% chance to produce an extra urn when adding runes to them.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Fletching</col> - 25% increased Fletching experience.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Herblore</col> - Extra 2.5% chance to save a secondary ingredient when mixing potions.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Smithing</col> - Double respect and luminite injector effect in the Artisans' Workshop.
data=col5,1,<col=FF981F>Runecrafting</col> - Increased node spawns and double runes at Runespan.
